  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: While Loop
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'Now we will introduce another form of loop. In the previous simulation,
    we used a <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#D96DD3>for</color></font> loop. A
    <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#D96DD3>for</color></font> loop is usually used
    when we know exactly how many times an action needs to repeat.


    Now we will
    try using a <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#D96DD3>while</color></font> loop.
    A <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#D96DD3>while</color></font> loop is usually
    used when we want an action to repeat as long as a <color=yellow>condition</color>
    remains <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#55AAFF>True</color></font>.


    The
    goal is the same as the simulation before this, but this time, we do not know
    exactly where the goal is located! You will need to rely on a condition to tell
    your program when to stop.'
  isImageBig: 0
